OL,8,     FJuarez, which adjoins El Paso on
OL,9,     Fthe other side of the border, the
OL,10,     Ftwo effectively forming a single
OL,11,     Flarge city with 57 miles of border
OL,12,     Fwalls.
OL,13,G0020 Top Gear
OL,14,     FThe guys compete in a race to the
OL,15,     Fski slopes - Jeremy by road in a
OL,16,     FFerrari 612 Scaglietti, while
OL,17,     FJames and Richard take to the air.
